	<TextRow
		Label="msg_d10r0301_swrival_11"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>[Name:TrainerName Idx="1" ]『……そっか▼
あいつに　あえたなら
アンタらの　つみほろぼし　だっけ？▽
てつだってやるよ▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-23T09:50:22" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-23T09:50:22" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>[Name:TrainerName Idx="1" ]『……そっか▼
あいつに　会えたなら
アンタらの　罪滅ぼし　だっけ？▽
手伝ってやるよ▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-23T09:50:22" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-23T09:50:22" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・！マーク表示後にメッセージ
・ライバル移動
　主人公もフリームーブへ</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-23T09:50:22" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SWRIVAL
ライバル</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-23T09:50:22" />
		</AttributeCell>
