	<TextRow
		Label="msg_d10r0301_hakaim1_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ポケモンの　きもちを　むしして
トレーナーから　きりはなすな！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-12T11:24:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-23T09:50:22" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ポケモンの　気持ちを　無視して
トレーナーから　切り離すな！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-12T11:24:19" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-23T09:50:22" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
