			<Comment>♂
・ゲーチス戦終了まで</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-23T09:50:22" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>HAKAIM
元プラズマ団♂その１</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-23T09:50:22" />
		</AttributeCell>
